  "targetAge": 8,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON』のアイテムが『30 MINUTES MISSIONS』シリーズで商品化。",
      "en": "\"ARMORED CORE VI FIRES OF RUBICON \" items are commercialized in the \" 30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" series."
    },
    {
      "ja": "シリーズのキーコンセプト「シンプル組み立て」「カスタム遊び」のもと、V.IIスネイルが操る「オープンフェイス」が登場。",
      "en": "Based on the series' key concepts of \"simple assembly \" and \" custom play,\" the \" Open Face\" operated by V.II Snail is now available."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部、コア、腕部、脚部それぞれにシリーズ共通構造を採用し、ゲーム内同様に「アセンブル」をプラモデルで楽しめる。",
      "en": "• The head, core, arms, and legs each use the same structure as the series, allowing you to enjoy \"assembling\" the plastic model just like in the game."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 両肩武器と一部左手武器の取り付けには3mmジョイントを採用し様々なアセンブルに対応可能。",
      "en": "• 3mm joints are used to attach both shoulder weapons and some left-handed weapons, allowing for a variety of assemblies."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武器は「VP-66EG」「VE-67LLA」「VE-60SNA」「Vvc-70VPM」が付属。",
      "en": "• Weapons include \"VP-66EG \", \" VE-67LLA \", \" VE-60SNA \", and \" Vvc-70VPM\"."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「VE-67LLA」は格納状態と展開状態の2種類に加えエフェクトパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• \"VE-67LLA\" comes in two types: retracted state and expanded state, as well as effect parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 別売りの「アクションベース7」等に接続可能なアーマーパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with armor parts that can be connected to \"Action Base 7\" etc. sold separately."
    }
  ],
